1
00:01:35,280 --> 00:01:36,319
Let me tell you, you're done for.

2
00:01:36,319 --> 00:01:36,840
You're done.

3
00:01:36,840 --> 00:01:38,000
Get ready to rot in jail.

4
00:01:38,000 --> 00:01:38,640
So what?

5
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:39,640
What about it?

6
00:01:39,760 --> 00:01:41,280
My sister is the chief here.

7
00:01:41,359 --> 00:01:42,319
Keep bluffing.

8
00:01:42,439 --> 00:01:44,239
And the police chief is my cousin.

9
00:01:44,280 --> 00:01:45,599
Cut the crap.

10
00:01:46,400 --> 00:01:46,920
Squat down.

11
00:01:48,239 --> 00:01:48,599
Now.

12
00:01:48,640 --> 00:01:49,000
Keep bragging.

13
00:01:54,519 --> 00:01:55,439
Just you wait. You're done.

14
00:01:55,599 --> 00:01:56,120
I'm waiting.

15
00:01:56,239 --> 00:01:56,959
Just you watch.

16
00:01:57,000 --> 00:01:57,719
Just wait for the law to punish you.

17
00:01:57,719 --> 00:01:58,200
Still at it, huh?

18
00:01:58,439 --> 00:01:58,920
Just you wait.

19
00:01:58,920 --> 00:01:59,640
What's going on here?

20
00:02:00,920 --> 00:02:01,879
Sis, you're finally here.

21
00:02:01,879 --> 00:02:02,480
You have to stand up for me.

22
00:02:02,480 --> 00:02:03,519
He beat up your brother.

23
00:02:03,760 --> 00:02:05,799
A huge fruit platter smashed right onto my head.

24
00:02:05,799 --> 00:02:06,560
Look at these bloody marks.

25
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:07,680
They're all huge bloody bumps.

26
00:02:07,840 --> 00:02:09,360
These four girls are all witnesses.

27
00:02:09,680 --> 00:02:10,520
Look at my head. You just...

28
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:10,840
Get down.

29
00:02:11,560 --> 00:02:11,919
I'm your...

30
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:12,680
Keep quiet.

31
00:02:15,240 --> 00:02:16,000
What's going on?

32
00:02:16,599 --> 00:02:17,520
Chief, he scammed me.

33
00:02:17,639 --> 00:02:18,120
Stay down and speak.

34
00:02:18,240 --> 00:02:18,680
Stay down.

35
00:02:18,840 --> 00:02:20,599
I got mad and lost control.

36
00:02:21,199 --> 00:02:23,000
I'm injured too. It was a mutual fight.

37
00:02:23,120 --> 00:02:23,840
Bullshit.

38
00:02:23,879 --> 00:02:25,360
I'm injured too. I have internal injuries.

39
00:02:25,759 --> 00:02:26,199
Let me tell you,

40
00:02:26,199 --> 00:02:27,280
I'm taking you to get checked right now.

41
00:02:27,280 --> 00:02:28,400
If you don't have internal injuries,

42
00:02:28,400 --> 00:02:29,439
I'll charge you with extortion.

43
00:02:30,319 --> 00:02:32,080
I have high BP, fatty liver, and gout.

44
00:02:32,080 --> 00:02:34,479
Can a beating cause gout and high BP?

45
00:02:36,520 --> 00:02:37,599
Sis, lock him up.

46
00:02:37,639 --> 00:02:38,159
Shut your mouth.

47
00:02:39,599 --> 00:02:40,840
Li Zhi, you handle this.

48
00:02:41,439 --> 00:02:42,159
I need to recuse myself.

49
00:02:42,919 --> 00:02:43,520
You, come with me.

50
00:02:43,680 --> 00:02:44,599
You, come here.

51
00:02:45,400 --> 00:02:47,159
How can you just ignore my case, sis?

52
00:02:47,439 --> 00:02:49,080
Didn't I tell you on the phone I'd check?

53
00:02:49,680 --> 00:02:50,719
Why are you two causing trouble here?

54
00:02:51,680 --> 00:02:52,719
I'm sorry, Chief Ji.

55
00:02:53,879 --> 00:02:55,919
Li Jianan has been missing for too long.

56
00:02:55,919 --> 00:02:57,080
I'm so worried about her.

57
00:02:57,759 --> 00:02:58,919
She trusts me so much.

58
00:02:59,479 --> 00:03:00,520
I want to do something for her.

59
00:03:00,520 --> 00:03:03,000
You didn't need to pose as a club hostess.

60
00:03:04,400 --> 00:03:04,800
I know.

61
00:03:11,240 --> 00:03:12,080
Did you find any clues?

62
00:03:12,800 --> 00:03:13,319
I did.

63
00:03:13,960 --> 00:03:14,719
Li Jianan went missing from

64
00:03:14,719 --> 00:03:16,000
that Mingliu Club.

65
00:03:16,319 --> 00:03:17,400
And her disappearance

66
00:03:17,400 --> 00:03:18,439
might be related to drugs.

67
00:03:24,000 --> 00:03:26,520
That girl only said Li Jianan used drugs.

68
00:03:26,520 --> 00:03:28,240
But whether she saw it with her own eyes,

69
00:03:28,360 --> 00:03:29,479
I'm still not quite sure.

70
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,280
But I can guarantee

71
00:03:31,280 --> 00:03:33,120
that before Li Jianan went to Mingliu,

72
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,240
she definitely wasn't using drugs.

73
00:03:36,759 --> 00:03:38,479
What about after you left the restroom?

74
00:03:39,479 --> 00:03:40,520
After coming out,

75
00:03:40,520 --> 00:03:43,479
I saw Chief Ji's brother

76
00:03:43,520 --> 00:03:45,120
fighting with that other guy.

77
00:03:45,639 --> 00:03:47,039
Then I called the police.

78
00:03:47,199 --> 00:03:49,000
And then we all went to the station.

79
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,319
What brother?

80
00:03:54,680 --> 00:03:55,520
Bi Dawei.

81
00:03:56,680 --> 00:03:57,280
Bi Dawei?

82
00:03:58,360 --> 00:03:59,120
Boss Bi.

83
00:04:01,159 --> 00:04:03,400
Uh, think carefully.

84
00:04:04,199 --> 00:04:05,840
Did you overlook anything?

85
00:04:06,039 --> 00:04:07,319
Was there anything out of the ordinary?

86
00:04:08,439 --> 00:04:09,800
Out of the ordinary...

87
00:04:12,039 --> 00:04:13,800
The alcohol there was very strange.

88
00:04:15,319 --> 00:04:16,759
Boss Bi ordered a bottle,

89
00:04:16,759 --> 00:04:18,240
and that one bottle cost 88,000.

90
00:04:19,040 --> 00:04:19,399
Hold on.

91
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,120
What kind of alcohol costs 88,000?

92
00:04:25,120 --> 00:04:25,839
Was it good?

93
00:04:27,000 --> 00:04:27,879
No, it wasn't.

94
00:04:28,600 --> 00:04:30,000
I wanted to throw up after just one sip.

95
00:04:30,279 --> 00:04:31,839
It tasted like it was spiked with alcohol.

96
00:04:34,879 --> 00:04:36,920
Two SWAT detachment leaders reporting.

97
00:04:37,160 --> 00:04:38,279
Commissar Tan, Captain Liao.

98
00:04:38,279 --> 00:04:39,160
Wipe that smile off your face.

99
00:04:40,600 --> 00:04:41,439
Let me tell you,

100
00:04:42,079 --> 00:04:43,040
your female SWAT officers

101
00:04:43,959 --> 00:04:44,600
went undercover

102
00:04:45,079 --> 00:04:46,120
and stormed a nightclub.

103
00:04:46,800 --> 00:04:47,839
Not bad for the SWAT detachment.

104
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:50,879
They said they acted on their own.

105
00:04:51,319 --> 00:04:52,199
You decide how to handle it.

106
00:05:01,319 --> 00:05:02,360
I know about this.

107
00:05:06,600 --> 00:05:07,480
Lao Tan, go ahead.

108
00:05:11,000 --> 00:05:11,720
I know about it.

109
00:05:15,519 --> 00:05:16,040
Lao Tan,

110
00:05:17,399 --> 00:05:19,839
you shouldn't know about this, right?

111
00:05:21,120 --> 00:05:22,240
Why shouldn't I know?

112
00:05:23,199 --> 00:05:24,199
They're both my officers.

113
00:05:24,879 --> 00:05:26,600
If there's an issue, just come to me.

114
00:05:27,399 --> 00:05:29,160
Whatever responsibility falls on our team,

115
00:05:30,519 --> 00:05:31,519
we will not shirk.

116
00:05:40,759 --> 00:05:41,360
See that?

117
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:43,759
They're in sync now.

118
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,000
And they're protective of their own.

119
00:05:47,160 --> 00:05:48,319
More than just protective.

120
00:05:49,240 --> 00:05:50,240
Lao Tan is now...

121
00:05:53,680 --> 00:05:54,800
What exactly happened with those two?

122
00:05:55,079 --> 00:05:55,920
Nothing major.

123
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:58,199
They accidentally stumbled upon a clue.

124
00:05:58,480 --> 00:05:59,319
So they deserve some credit.

125
00:06:12,800 --> 00:06:14,319
Are you three messing with us?

126
00:06:15,279 --> 00:06:16,040
Come here.

127
00:06:16,240 --> 00:06:17,759
Okay, fine.

128
00:06:21,560 --> 00:06:22,560
Who told you two to sit down?

129
00:06:23,319 --> 00:06:24,480
It's fine. Sit down.

130
00:06:25,639 --> 00:06:26,319
Zhang Peng.

131
00:06:26,639 --> 00:06:28,800
There's paid companionship at Mingliu Club.

132
00:06:28,800 --> 00:06:29,639
How do you think we should handle it?

133
00:06:30,680 --> 00:06:31,600
Handle it as usual.

134
00:06:32,120 --> 00:06:33,199
Investigate and fine them as needed.

135
00:06:33,759 --> 00:06:35,480
Didn't Chief Guo say regarding Lu Haifeng...

136
00:06:35,480 --> 00:06:36,240
we should keep it low-profile?

137
00:06:36,759 --> 00:06:38,120
You've already arrested the girls.

138
00:06:38,120 --> 00:06:40,240
Laying low now will just raise suspicions.

139
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:40,720
Lao Ji.

140
00:06:42,720 --> 00:06:43,360
Well...

141
00:06:44,319 --> 00:06:46,839
Is your brother really that... that loaded?

142
00:06:47,600 --> 00:06:48,480
Cousin.

143
00:06:49,319 --> 00:06:50,439
Right, cousin.

144
00:06:51,720 --> 00:06:54,240
Introduce me to your cousin someday.

145
00:06:55,240 --> 00:06:55,800
Why?

146
00:06:56,560 --> 00:06:57,480
No reason.

147
00:06:57,519 --> 00:06:59,000
I just want to ask him if that...

148
00:06:59,000 --> 00:07:00,160
88,000 yuan liquor tastes good.

149
00:07:05,639 --> 00:07:06,399
No, really.

150
00:07:07,319 --> 00:07:08,519
I'll ask him when we meet.

151
00:07:10,800 --> 00:07:12,000
No discipline, no regard for the rules.

152
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:15,240
Commissar, Bai Jiani was just worried.

153
00:07:15,800 --> 00:07:17,040
That girl has been missing for so long.

154
00:07:17,279 --> 00:07:18,360
Lu Xiao, you're not off the hook either.

155
00:07:19,759 --> 00:07:20,879
You withheld information.

156
00:07:22,120 --> 00:07:23,399
Didn't Chief Ji say

157
00:07:23,560 --> 00:07:25,160
that we deserve credit for finding clues?

158
00:07:25,240 --> 00:07:25,839
What credit?

159
00:07:26,480 --> 00:07:27,079
What credit?

160
00:07:27,480 --> 00:07:29,279
That was just blind luck.

161
00:07:29,519 --> 00:07:30,480
Credit, my foot.

162
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:35,600
Commissar, I did it.

163
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,120
And I made the decision.

164
00:07:37,360 --> 00:07:38,680
I'll accept whatever punishment you give.

165
00:07:38,920 --> 00:07:39,759
Right, we'll write self-criticisms.

166
00:07:45,839 --> 00:07:47,519
Have you two thought about the "what ifs"?

167
00:07:50,680 --> 00:07:51,800
What if something went wrong?

168
00:07:52,839 --> 00:07:53,480
Who'd take responsibility?

169
00:07:55,000 --> 00:07:55,920
Who could take responsibility?

170
00:07:59,319 --> 00:08:01,040
Irrational judgment

171
00:08:01,720 --> 00:08:02,920
leads to dangerous consequences.

172
00:08:08,759 --> 00:08:10,480
Could you two handle that?

173
00:08:13,399 --> 00:08:14,319
Write self-criticisms?

174
00:08:14,920 --> 00:08:16,800
A bureau-wide notice wouldn't be too much.

175
00:08:22,519 --> 00:08:26,199
Good experience comes from hard lessons.

176
00:08:28,399 --> 00:08:28,839
Tell you what.

177
00:08:29,839 --> 00:08:31,920
Take this profound lesson,

178
00:08:32,240 --> 00:08:33,600
what happened at Mingliu Club,

179
00:08:34,039 --> 00:08:37,879
and explain it to the team in detail.

180
00:08:39,600 --> 00:08:40,720
That's too embarrassing, Commissar.

181
00:08:41,039 --> 00:08:42,080
Go change your clothes, hurry.

182
00:08:42,080 --> 00:08:42,440
Yes, sir.

183
00:08:42,720 --> 00:08:43,799
Thank you, Captain Liao and Commissar.

184
00:08:45,279 --> 00:08:46,120
Tell them one by one.

185
00:08:51,799 --> 00:08:53,399
They really are a handful.

186
00:08:55,600 --> 00:08:57,320
They've learned their lesson this time.

187
00:09:00,919 --> 00:09:01,559
Commissar Tan.

188
00:09:02,840 --> 00:09:04,320
Is Chief Ji joining the task force

189
00:09:04,799 --> 00:09:06,320
because he provided clues?

190
00:09:12,519 --> 00:09:14,320
Bai Jiani provided clues too.

191
00:09:16,519 --> 00:09:17,600
This is an opportunity.

192
00:09:19,080 --> 00:09:20,000
We need to fight for it.

193
00:09:26,639 --> 00:09:28,240
Don't be in such a rush to take a seat.

194
00:09:30,679 --> 00:09:31,919
Let's find out the situation first.

195
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:47,879
Pengpeng, you still awake?

196
00:09:49,720 --> 00:09:51,639
I need to discuss something with you.

197
00:10:05,639 --> 00:10:07,080
Captain Lin, the totals are in.

198
00:10:07,720 --> 00:10:09,559
The total spending is 13.47 million.

199
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:26,559
Wow.

200
00:10:28,200 --> 00:10:31,320
Over 10 million just to sing a song.

201
00:10:32,600 --> 00:10:33,440
What a big spender.

202
00:10:45,200 --> 00:10:45,720
Lao Ji,

203
00:10:46,600 --> 00:10:47,399
there's something

204
00:10:47,919 --> 00:10:48,799
you need to help me with.

205
00:10:59,600 --> 00:10:59,960
Dawei

206
00:11:00,360 --> 00:11:00,679
Sis

207
00:11:01,799 --> 00:11:03,159
Didn't we settle the fighting incident?

208
00:11:03,159 --> 00:11:04,159
Why did you call me in again?

209
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:04,759
It's about something else.

210
00:11:04,919 --> 00:11:05,799
It has nothing to do with the fight.

211
00:11:06,080 --> 00:11:07,360
This is Captain Lin from Economic Crimes.

212
00:11:08,840 --> 00:11:09,279
Mr. Bi

213
00:11:09,919 --> 00:11:10,399
Have a seat.

214
00:11:10,440 --> 00:11:11,279
Officer Lin

215
00:11:12,159 --> 00:11:13,279
has some questions for you.

216
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,480
You need to cooperate.

217
00:11:17,000 --> 00:11:18,200
Why so serious?

218
00:11:18,200 --> 00:11:18,720
It's quite scary.

219
00:11:19,159 --> 00:11:21,159
I heard Mr. Bi likes to

220
00:11:21,519 --> 00:11:23,799
hang out at clubs and such.

221
00:11:24,759 --> 00:11:26,879
Our environment here is a bit shabby.

222
00:11:26,879 --> 00:11:27,519
I apologize for that.

223
00:11:28,960 --> 00:11:30,200
It's fine, it's nothing.

224
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:33,279
I heard Mr. Bi likes to go

225
00:11:33,279 --> 00:11:35,559
to a club called Mingliu.

226
00:11:36,000 --> 00:11:37,080
The decor there is quite nice.

227
00:11:37,519 --> 00:11:38,320
Just a little expensive.

228
00:11:39,679 --> 00:11:40,200
Yeah.

229
00:11:40,919 --> 00:11:42,799
We just use it to entertain clients.

230
00:11:43,080 --> 00:11:44,039
The high prices

231
00:11:44,039 --> 00:11:46,000
make the clients feel respected.

232
00:11:46,000 --> 00:11:46,679
And we're happy with that.

233
00:11:48,840 --> 00:11:50,279
Tens of thousands for fake liquor...

234
00:11:51,240 --> 00:11:52,000
That's not really worth it, is it?

235
00:11:53,000 --> 00:11:53,759
Fake liquor?

236
00:11:54,679 --> 00:11:56,279
How could it be fake liquor?

237
00:11:57,639 --> 00:11:57,960
Right.

238
00:11:58,559 --> 00:11:59,320
That's not important.

239
00:11:59,720 --> 00:12:00,679
As long as you drink happily.

240
00:12:02,600 --> 00:12:03,440
Mr. Bi, take a look at this.

241
00:12:03,799 --> 00:12:04,639
Here are the itemized records

242
00:12:04,639 --> 00:12:06,879
of your spending at Mingliu over two years.

243
00:12:07,279 --> 00:12:08,159
The total is

244
00:12:08,200 --> 00:12:12,279
13,475,210.

245
00:12:13,080 --> 00:12:13,759
Take a look.

246
00:12:23,039 --> 00:12:23,639
Officer Lin,

247
00:12:24,440 --> 00:12:26,360
this is quite detailed.

248
00:12:26,399 --> 00:12:28,240
I wouldn't know if you hadn't told me.

249
00:12:29,080 --> 00:12:30,200
I never kept track.

250
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,559
How could I keep track over so many years?

251
00:12:33,799 --> 00:12:35,240
You're truly generous, Mr. Bi.

252
00:12:36,720 --> 00:12:37,639
A real big spender.

253
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:39,600
Forgetting you spent over 10 million.

254
00:12:40,360 --> 00:12:41,840
I'm no big spender.

255
00:12:41,840 --> 00:12:44,279
I'm just used to spending freely.

256
00:12:45,080 --> 00:12:46,679
My sister knows about this bad habit too.

257
00:12:47,039 --> 00:12:48,159
I spend three for every one I earn.

258
00:12:49,840 --> 00:12:52,039
I completely understand spending freely.

259
00:12:52,759 --> 00:12:55,080
But your MCN company

260
00:12:55,360 --> 00:12:58,519
has a yearly cash flow of over 20 million.

261
00:12:59,360 --> 00:13:02,279
You somehow take out over half of that

262
00:13:02,559 --> 00:13:04,639
for PR and entertainment?

263
00:13:06,200 --> 00:13:07,600
I don't quite understand that.

264
00:13:10,360 --> 00:13:12,919
It's all PR expenses, business needs.

265
00:13:13,639 --> 00:13:14,440
PR?

266
00:13:14,879 --> 00:13:15,960
Who are you doing PR for?

267
00:13:15,960 --> 00:13:17,639
Well, doesn't our livestreaming company

268
00:13:17,639 --> 00:13:19,279
make money from tips?

269
00:13:19,440 --> 00:13:21,159
The top donor, the second top donor...

270
00:13:21,279 --> 00:13:22,360
Don't we have to maintain ties with them?

271
00:13:23,159 --> 00:13:23,519
Right.

272
00:13:24,159 --> 00:13:27,720
But the tips from your top donor

273
00:13:28,440 --> 00:13:29,960
aren't even enough to cover your PR costs.

274
00:13:30,799 --> 00:13:32,240
So what's your goal, Mr. Bi?

275
00:13:33,080 --> 00:13:34,039
To make friends.

276
00:13:34,679 --> 00:13:35,519
Exactly.

277
00:13:35,600 --> 00:13:37,000
More friends make things easier.

278
00:13:37,000 --> 00:13:37,200
Then

279
00:13:37,480 --> 00:13:38,960
I can make even more money.

280
00:13:41,159 --> 00:13:41,679
Dawei,

281
00:13:43,159 --> 00:13:44,200
for the minor stuff in the past,

282
00:13:44,200 --> 00:13:44,960
I could just give you a warning.

283
00:13:45,799 --> 00:13:46,679
This time is different.

284
00:13:47,720 --> 00:13:49,279
Captain Lin wouldn't just

285
00:13:49,279 --> 00:13:50,440
call you here to chat for no reason.

286
00:13:51,919 --> 00:13:52,759
You'd better tell the truth.

287
00:13:54,120 --> 00:13:55,080
Don't waste everyone's time.

288
00:13:55,799 --> 00:13:56,360
Dawei,

289
00:13:57,440 --> 00:13:59,440
since we have this connection,

290
00:14:00,360 --> 00:14:01,440
let's stop beating around the bush.

291
00:14:02,279 --> 00:14:03,799
Where did this money come from?

292
00:14:04,600 --> 00:14:05,639
And how was it spent?

293
00:14:06,440 --> 00:14:07,720
Let's lay it all out on the table, okay?

294
00:14:08,960 --> 00:14:09,320
Captain Lin,

295
00:14:09,320 --> 00:14:10,519
haven't I already told you?

296
00:14:10,519 --> 00:14:12,039
We are a livestreaming company.

297
00:14:12,039 --> 00:14:13,159
The money made from tips

298
00:14:13,360 --> 00:14:14,519
is shared with the streamers,

299
00:14:14,720 --> 00:14:16,840
and the rest is used to maintain clients

300
00:14:17,080 --> 00:14:18,200
and relationships.

301
00:14:18,360 --> 00:14:19,440
And then it's spent.

302
00:14:24,279 --> 00:14:26,200
This is your streamers' revenue data.

303
00:14:27,080 --> 00:14:28,440
Their tips are highly abnormal.

304
00:14:29,519 --> 00:14:31,159
Way higher than they should normally be.

305
00:14:34,480 --> 00:14:35,159
This... this...

306
00:14:35,600 --> 00:14:37,200
This is totally normal.

307
00:14:37,200 --> 00:14:39,720
The top fan likes our streamer.

308
00:14:39,919 --> 00:14:40,799
She's pretty.

309
00:14:40,799 --> 00:14:41,559
So he tips her.

310
00:14:42,000 --> 00:14:44,360
He sends dozens of Carnivals a night.

311
00:14:44,720 --> 00:14:46,240
This... this is totally normal.

312
00:14:46,279 --> 00:14:46,799
Dawei.

313
00:14:47,600 --> 00:14:49,399
We've already checked their accounts.

314
00:14:49,799 --> 00:14:51,039
Those accounts are not normal.

315
00:14:51,480 --> 00:14:54,000
They involve underground financial trades.

316
00:14:55,440 --> 00:14:57,120
What... what does that have to do with me?

317
00:14:57,120 --> 00:14:59,279
Your cash flow has abnormal fund returns.

318
00:14:59,279 --> 00:15:00,440
You think that has nothing to do with you?

319
00:15:00,679 --> 00:15:02,159
Whether the financial accounts are normal,

320
00:15:02,159 --> 00:15:03,360
how am I supposed to control that?

321
00:15:03,360 --> 00:15:04,559
Besides, if people tip me,

322
00:15:04,879 --> 00:15:05,960
I can't exactly stop them.

323
00:15:06,240 --> 00:15:06,679
Dawei.

324
00:15:07,639 --> 00:15:09,080
If you still won't tell the truth,

325
00:15:09,360 --> 00:15:10,519
we'll just process you by the book.

326
00:15:11,159 --> 00:15:12,279
It's fine, let him make things up.

327
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,159
He'll run out of lies eventually.

328
00:15:14,799 --> 00:15:15,600
When that happens,

329
00:15:16,240 --> 00:15:18,279
you'll lose the chance for leniency.

330
00:15:18,799 --> 00:15:20,120
I'm not making things up.

331
00:15:20,279 --> 00:15:22,240
Your company almost failed two years ago.

332
00:15:22,960 --> 00:15:24,759
Then a huge sum of money suddenly came in.

333
00:15:25,360 --> 00:15:26,799
They tipped you in your live streams.

334
00:15:27,159 --> 00:15:27,559
Right?

335
00:15:29,360 --> 00:15:30,000
Yes.

336
00:15:31,159 --> 00:15:32,639
Someone did contact me.

337
00:15:33,000 --> 00:15:33,759
They said they wanted to cooperate.

338
00:15:33,879 --> 00:15:35,639
Then they bought a massive amount of bots

339
00:15:36,000 --> 00:15:36,879
to boost our traffic.

340
00:15:37,240 --> 00:15:38,679
They also registered a lot of accounts

341
00:15:38,799 --> 00:15:40,120
to send tips in our live streams.

342
00:15:40,679 --> 00:15:42,799
After the money entered our account,

343
00:15:42,960 --> 00:15:44,360
we'd keep a portion as commission,

344
00:15:44,799 --> 00:15:46,759
and spend the rest at Mingliu Club.

345
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,159
Buying memberships.

346
00:15:48,799 --> 00:15:50,399
We ate, drank, and had fun for free,

347
00:15:51,080 --> 00:15:52,559
so it didn't really affect me.

348
00:15:54,480 --> 00:15:57,279
It looks like high-end entertainment.

349
00:15:57,840 --> 00:16:00,440
In reality, you turned their illegal funds

350
00:16:00,879 --> 00:16:02,000
into legitimate income.

351
00:16:02,759 --> 00:16:04,120
Do you know what this is called?

352
00:16:05,320 --> 00:16:06,279
This is called money laundering.

353
00:16:07,480 --> 00:16:08,240
Officer Lin.

354
00:16:08,639 --> 00:16:09,960
Don't scare me, okay?

355
00:16:09,960 --> 00:16:10,799
I wash... wash what?

356
00:16:10,960 --> 00:16:11,960
I don't even wash my own clothes.

357
00:16:12,000 --> 00:16:13,279
How could I wash money?

358
00:16:13,879 --> 00:16:14,799
We only made that little bit of money.

359
00:16:14,799 --> 00:16:15,639
They just made us

360
00:16:15,639 --> 00:16:17,200
go spend it at that Mingliu Club.

361
00:16:19,799 --> 00:16:22,440
Why don't you go ask Mingliu Club?

362
00:16:22,440 --> 00:16:23,279
Investigate them!

363
00:16:23,279 --> 00:16:24,480
See if they're the ones laundering money.

364
00:16:32,080 --> 00:16:33,080
With money laundering,

365
00:16:33,559 --> 00:16:34,679
if the circumstances are severe,

366
00:16:35,159 --> 00:16:36,360
you could get up to ten years in prison.

367
00:16:38,879 --> 00:16:40,360
I won't follow up on this anymore then.

368
00:16:41,279 --> 00:16:43,200
I really have to thank you, Chief Ji.

369
00:16:43,519 --> 00:16:44,440
If you hadn't been there,

370
00:16:45,399 --> 00:16:46,720
he wouldn't have confessed so quickly.

371
00:16:51,679 --> 00:16:53,240
Lang Tao was the starting point.

372
00:16:54,559 --> 00:16:57,120
Through this kid who transported drugs,

373
00:16:58,000 --> 00:17:00,360
we found suspected overseas accounts

374
00:17:00,559 --> 00:17:02,080
of the "Spring Snow" drug cartel.

375
00:17:02,600 --> 00:17:03,240
No, hold on a second.

376
00:17:03,559 --> 00:17:05,039
Could you not talk so slowly?

377
00:17:05,039 --> 00:17:06,599
There's a whole bunch of us waiting here.

378
00:17:07,319 --> 00:17:08,000
No, bro.

379
00:17:08,200 --> 00:17:08,880
The drug money.

380
00:17:09,480 --> 00:17:10,559
You know about the drug money, right?

381
00:17:10,680 --> 00:17:11,119
I know.

382
00:17:11,240 --> 00:17:12,160
The drug money goes around,

383
00:17:12,200 --> 00:17:13,559
goes around in a circle and comes back

384
00:17:13,559 --> 00:17:14,920
to the Hongye money laundering syndicate.

385
00:17:14,920 --> 00:17:16,200
Alright, keep going, keep going.

386
00:17:17,319 --> 00:17:18,160
Keep going, keep going.

387
00:17:20,000 --> 00:17:20,599
Where was I?

388
00:17:21,839 --> 00:17:23,640
After it gets into the hands of this

389
00:17:23,640 --> 00:17:24,640
Hongye money laundering syndicate,

390
00:17:24,960 --> 00:17:26,079
they split this drug money

391
00:17:26,400 --> 00:17:27,559
into several small chunks.

392
00:17:28,079 --> 00:17:29,599
They scatter it across live streams.

393
00:17:30,039 --> 00:17:31,920
They use it to tip on various platforms.

394
00:17:32,680 --> 00:17:34,440
After this drug money is laundered,

395
00:17:34,799 --> 00:17:38,039
it takes the form of spending and top-ups

396
00:17:38,559 --> 00:17:39,799
and goes straight into this Mingliu Club.

397
00:17:40,720 --> 00:17:41,480
In other words,

398
00:17:42,279 --> 00:17:42,920
right now, this money

399
00:17:42,920 --> 00:17:44,240
has all landed in Mingliu Club,

400
00:17:45,039 --> 00:17:45,880
in the hands of Lu Haifeng.

401
00:17:51,279 --> 00:17:52,839
It did end up in Lu Haifeng's hands,

402
00:17:53,880 --> 00:17:56,240
but whether or not

403
00:17:56,799 --> 00:17:58,160
Lu Haifeng is the last stop,

404
00:17:58,880 --> 00:17:59,759
we're still not sure about that.

405
00:18:01,039 --> 00:18:02,279
Now you're not sure?

406
00:18:03,079 --> 00:18:04,920
Chief Guo, I'm very sure.

407
00:18:05,559 --> 00:18:06,279
This Lu Haifeng...

408
00:18:07,000 --> 00:18:09,680
must be deeply connected to "Spring Snow".

409
00:18:10,319 --> 00:18:11,039
Here, you go ahead.

410
00:18:11,039 --> 00:18:12,200
No, the problem right now is...

411
00:18:12,559 --> 00:18:13,400
Alright, knock it off.

412
00:18:14,000 --> 00:18:14,559
Chief Guo is right here.

413
00:18:15,000 --> 00:18:16,319
He's been like this since school.

414
00:18:16,319 --> 00:18:16,720
Yeah.

415
00:18:17,480 --> 00:18:18,680
The problem right now is,

416
00:18:18,759 --> 00:18:20,279
if they insist

417
00:18:20,279 --> 00:18:21,759
it was just normal spending, then what?

418
00:18:22,480 --> 00:18:24,319
At most, we can charge him with laundering.

419
00:18:24,319 --> 00:18:25,279
We can't charge him with drug trafficking.

420
00:18:25,480 --> 00:18:25,680
Hold on.

421
00:18:25,680 --> 00:18:27,680
Did you not hear what Lin Nan just said?

422
00:18:28,000 --> 00:18:29,160
The summary he gave

423
00:18:29,160 --> 00:18:30,079
was already very comprehensive.

424
00:18:30,680 --> 00:18:31,279
And I think

425
00:18:31,559 --> 00:18:33,200
as long as we catch the suspect,

426
00:18:33,480 --> 00:18:34,880
we'll be able to find the evidence.

427
00:18:35,000 --> 00:18:35,400
Right?

428
00:18:36,039 --> 00:18:37,200
I still think the evidence isn't enough.

429
00:18:38,079 --> 00:18:39,200
With just this little bit of evidence,

430
00:18:39,680 --> 00:18:40,960
we can't arrest anyone at all.

431
00:18:49,039 --> 00:18:51,200
As for this money laundering lead,

432
00:18:51,400 --> 00:18:53,119
we really have to thank the SWAT team.

433
00:18:53,119 --> 00:18:53,759
Right, right.

434
00:18:54,720 --> 00:18:56,720
So about them joining the task force...

435
00:18:56,720 --> 00:18:57,480
I think...

436
00:18:57,640 --> 00:18:59,000
What do you think, Zhang Peng?

437
00:18:59,720 --> 00:19:01,759
You and Liao Bufan usually clash.

438
00:19:02,119 --> 00:19:03,480
Why are you speaking up for them now?

439
00:19:03,519 --> 00:19:04,680
No, no, no, Chief Guo.

440
00:19:04,960 --> 00:19:06,599
I just think we should be fair here.

441
00:19:07,240 --> 00:19:07,759
Look,

442
00:19:07,759 --> 00:19:09,759
if it weren't for Bai Jiani

443
00:19:09,960 --> 00:19:11,039
secretly investigating Mingliu Club,

444
00:19:11,559 --> 00:19:13,279
we wouldn't have found the Bi Dawei lead.

445
00:19:13,759 --> 00:19:14,480
So I...

446
00:19:14,759 --> 00:19:15,240
We just...

447
00:19:15,240 --> 00:19:17,200
Chief Guo, I've looked into this.

448
00:19:17,680 --> 00:19:19,480
If it weren't for the SWAT detachment

449
00:19:19,480 --> 00:19:20,400
helping investigate Mingliu Club,

450
00:19:20,559 --> 00:19:21,359
who knows if we

451
00:19:21,359 --> 00:19:23,440
would have figured it out even now.

452
00:19:24,079 --> 00:19:24,640
Alright.

453
00:19:25,279 --> 00:19:26,119
I know all about it.

454
00:19:26,839 --> 00:19:28,079
You two echoing each other,

455
00:19:28,400 --> 00:19:29,440
you're coordinating quite well.

456
00:19:30,200 --> 00:19:31,079
Whatever ideas Tan Yan has,

457
00:19:31,079 --> 00:19:31,960
have him come to me himself.

458
00:19:32,839 --> 00:19:34,119
Don't you guys get mixed up in it.

459
00:19:34,359 --> 00:19:34,559
No...

460
00:19:34,559 --> 00:19:34,880
Understood.

461
00:19:38,599 --> 00:19:39,920
You're useless, you.

462
00:19:40,079 --> 00:19:40,599
What?

463
00:19:43,440 --> 00:19:44,039
Understood.

464
00:19:46,799 --> 00:19:48,400
The police and commerce bureau both came?

465
00:19:48,519 --> 00:19:49,119
Yes.

466
00:19:49,319 --> 00:19:51,240
They said our club offers paid escorts,

467
00:19:51,480 --> 00:19:52,839
and ordered a three-month shutdown.

468
00:19:52,960 --> 00:19:53,799
And pay a fine.

469
00:19:54,279 --> 00:19:55,440
The fine is a small matter.

470
00:19:55,640 --> 00:19:57,240
But shutting down will cause huge losses.

471
00:19:58,799 --> 00:19:59,440
What about Mr. Bi?

472
00:19:59,880 --> 00:20:00,799
What did he tell you?

473
00:20:01,200 --> 00:20:02,559
He kept apologizing.

474
00:20:02,759 --> 00:20:03,599
Said he drank too much

475
00:20:03,759 --> 00:20:04,559
and let it slip.

476
00:20:05,359 --> 00:20:07,519
He's a key client, so I couldn't say much.

477
00:20:09,079 --> 00:20:10,799
Mr. Lu, why don't you pull some strings?

478
00:20:10,920 --> 00:20:12,160
Three months is way too long.

479
00:20:14,599 --> 00:20:15,640
Shut down if we have to.

480
00:20:16,039 --> 00:20:17,039
Rectify if we have to.

481
00:20:17,599 --> 00:20:19,839
As long as it's a lawful penalty,

482
00:20:20,559 --> 00:20:22,119
you fully cooperate, understand?

483
00:20:23,039 --> 00:20:24,440
Okay, Mr. Lu, I understand.

484
00:20:44,880 --> 00:20:45,400
Hello?

485
00:20:45,839 --> 00:20:46,359
Mr. Li.

486
00:20:47,599 --> 00:20:48,079
It's me.

487
00:20:49,000 --> 00:20:50,799
Those ground-floor shops at Qinghewan...

488
00:20:51,359 --> 00:20:52,400
Are you still interested?

489
00:20:53,079 --> 00:20:54,039
The price is negotiable.

490
00:21:25,240 --> 00:21:26,640
You made this yourself.

491
00:21:28,119 --> 00:21:29,720
You deserve to enjoy this one.

492
00:21:31,640 --> 00:21:32,200
I'm giving it to you.

493
00:21:53,519 --> 00:21:54,440
Isn't this great?

494
00:21:57,440 --> 00:21:59,000
You can create wealth,

495
00:22:00,319 --> 00:22:01,640
and enjoy it yourself.

496
00:22:04,000 --> 00:22:04,559
Perfect.

497
00:22:09,119 --> 00:22:10,599
We need to pick up the pace now.

498
00:22:11,960 --> 00:22:12,960
We can't run out of product.

499
00:22:13,599 --> 00:22:14,039
Got it?

500
00:22:23,880 --> 00:22:25,039
I'm talking to you.

501
00:22:30,119 --> 00:22:32,440
I'm talking to you. Did you hear me?

502
00:22:39,759 --> 00:22:40,400
Snap out of it.

503
00:22:43,119 --> 00:22:43,599
Look at me.

504
00:22:45,519 --> 00:22:46,000
Look at me.

505
00:22:48,359 --> 00:22:48,839
Look at me.

506
00:22:49,839 --> 00:22:50,279
Get up.

507
00:22:57,880 --> 00:22:59,000
He told me to go talk to him.

508
00:23:01,839 --> 00:23:04,319
So did Old Guo agree or not?

509
00:23:06,000 --> 00:23:07,559
From the sound of it, there's hope.

510
00:23:09,079 --> 00:23:09,559
Old Tan.

511
00:23:10,240 --> 00:23:11,640
I've said everything I could.

512
00:23:12,119 --> 00:23:13,920
Whether it works out is up to you.

513
00:23:14,839 --> 00:23:17,079
Either way, I gotta thank you guys.

514
00:23:18,559 --> 00:23:19,839
Alright, talk later.

515
00:23:23,119 --> 00:23:23,839
Is there a chance?

516
00:23:33,400 --> 00:23:35,799
Depends on how I talk to Old Guo.

517
00:23:37,319 --> 00:23:38,279
So how will you talk to him?

518
00:23:40,279 --> 00:23:41,119
In three steps.

519
00:23:41,920 --> 00:23:43,000
First, state the facts.

520
00:23:44,799 --> 00:23:47,160
Point out directly that our actions

521
00:23:47,160 --> 00:23:49,079
led to the task force's breakthrough.

522
00:23:51,279 --> 00:23:52,599
Then, reason with him.

523
00:23:55,119 --> 00:23:59,519
The SWAT team opened up the perimeter.

524
00:24:00,359 --> 00:24:04,160
Proving we can both fight and investigate.

525
00:24:05,440 --> 00:24:07,240
Finally, play the emotional card.

526
00:24:08,960 --> 00:24:10,799
It's not that we overstep our bounds,

527
00:24:11,240 --> 00:24:12,640
but that we want to cooperate closely.

528
00:24:13,119 --> 00:24:15,240
Joining the task force is only reasonable.

529
00:24:15,759 --> 00:24:16,480
What do you think, sir?

530
00:24:18,640 --> 00:24:19,079
Sir?

531
00:24:19,480 --> 00:24:19,759
Me?

532
00:24:20,519 --> 00:24:21,880
I think it's absolutely fine.

533
00:24:21,880 --> 00:24:22,599
That's great.

534
00:24:23,160 --> 00:24:24,119
So when are we going?

535
00:24:25,559 --> 00:24:26,039
We?

536
00:24:28,880 --> 00:24:30,119
I'll ask Captain Liu to come along then.

537
00:24:32,599 --> 00:24:35,359
For this, more people isn't always better.

538
00:24:40,400 --> 00:24:41,319
That's true.

539
00:24:41,960 --> 00:24:43,119
With my temper,

540
00:24:44,000 --> 00:24:45,240
I might say the wrong thing.

541
00:24:47,240 --> 00:24:48,759
You're more level-headed than us.

542
00:24:50,000 --> 00:24:50,759
Then you should go.

543
00:24:56,920 --> 00:24:59,400
Alright, I'll go solo.

544
00:25:02,079 --> 00:25:03,799
Chief Guo is my old boss.

545
00:25:04,319 --> 00:25:05,400
As for his temper,

546
00:25:05,920 --> 00:25:07,279
I know it inside out.

547
00:25:08,160 --> 00:25:10,839
The key is when to make the request,

548
00:25:11,440 --> 00:25:14,000
and when to give him a way out.

549
00:25:14,039 --> 00:25:15,160
Get the balance right,

550
00:25:15,400 --> 00:25:16,359
and it's a done deal.

551
00:25:16,839 --> 00:25:17,160
A done deal.

552
00:25:21,319 --> 00:25:23,279
Then I wish you the best of luck.

553
00:25:23,559 --> 00:25:24,319
I have to succeed.

554
00:25:30,920 --> 00:25:31,200
Chief.

555
00:25:31,200 --> 00:25:33,279
My wife just made this new filling.

556
00:25:33,480 --> 00:25:34,640
Shrimp and carrot.

557
00:25:37,200 --> 00:25:37,839
Try some.

558
00:25:47,480 --> 00:25:47,839
Garlic.

559
00:25:48,799 --> 00:25:49,640
That's too pungent.

560
00:25:50,519 --> 00:25:51,079
Smells great.

561
00:25:53,119 --> 00:25:53,599
Old Zhao,

562
00:25:54,640 --> 00:25:57,720
are you that anxious about the PR funding?

563
00:25:58,400 --> 00:25:58,920
No rush.

564
00:25:58,960 --> 00:25:59,799
Chief, no rush.

565
00:26:00,359 --> 00:26:01,680
I just wanted to bring you these buns...

566
00:26:01,720 --> 00:26:02,440
for you to try.

567
00:26:05,519 --> 00:26:05,960
Come in.

568
00:26:07,599 --> 00:26:08,240
Chief Guo.

569
00:26:11,119 --> 00:26:11,640
Director Zhao.

570
00:26:12,799 --> 00:26:13,519
Commissar Tan.

571
00:26:15,000 --> 00:26:15,759
You're... you're back.

572
00:26:16,160 --> 00:26:17,000
You're just in time.

573
00:26:19,279 --> 00:26:21,000
Tan Yan is an expert at steaming buns.

574
00:26:21,440 --> 00:26:22,599
Not at all, not at all.

575
00:26:22,640 --> 00:26:23,200
Come on, come here.

576
00:26:23,599 --> 00:26:24,079
Have a taste.

577
00:26:25,039 --> 00:26:26,559
Try the steamed buns Old Zhao made.

578
00:26:26,920 --> 00:26:27,680
I'm full.

579
00:26:27,680 --> 00:26:28,519
I ate before I came.

580
00:26:28,680 --> 00:26:29,079
Just try one.

581
00:26:30,880 --> 00:26:32,000
Director Zhao makes steamed buns now?

582
00:26:32,759 --> 00:26:33,319
Just showing off in front of an expert.

583
00:26:36,000 --> 00:26:37,359
They smell pretty good.

584
00:26:39,720 --> 00:26:40,200
The dough...

585
00:26:40,440 --> 00:26:42,240
It'd be better if the dough was thinner.

586
00:26:43,839 --> 00:26:44,680
The dough is too thick, right?

587
00:26:46,119 --> 00:26:46,799
A little bit.

588
00:26:47,880 --> 00:26:48,519
I rushed it.

589
00:26:49,519 --> 00:26:50,480
Right, I'll correct it.

590
00:26:50,720 --> 00:26:51,319
Look at that.

591
00:26:51,720 --> 00:26:53,160
You two are actually exchanging pointers.

592
00:26:54,960 --> 00:26:56,160
Actually, when it comes to steamed buns...

593
00:26:56,480 --> 00:26:57,680
the taste isn't in the pleats.

594
00:26:59,960 --> 00:27:01,839
But Tan Yan...

595
00:27:02,519 --> 00:27:03,599
is indeed an expert.

596
00:27:04,480 --> 00:27:05,240
A pro at steaming buns.

597
00:27:06,680 --> 00:27:07,880
What do you mean? Commissar Tan...

598
00:27:08,160 --> 00:27:09,559
is excellent in every aspect.

599
00:27:10,160 --> 00:27:11,200
I should learn from Director Zhao.

600
00:27:15,559 --> 00:27:16,480
You... you're not having any?

601
00:27:16,480 --> 00:27:17,119
No, I...

602
00:27:17,680 --> 00:27:18,640
Then... then you...

603
00:27:18,640 --> 00:27:19,640
You chat with the Chief.

604
00:27:19,759 --> 00:27:20,799
I have some work to do.

605
00:27:21,440 --> 00:27:21,799
Okay, okay.

606
00:27:22,880 --> 00:27:23,680
Same here.

607
00:27:23,680 --> 00:27:25,119
I have a "Green Hongye"...

608
00:27:25,400 --> 00:27:26,759
anti-vice meeting later...

609
00:27:26,759 --> 00:27:27,559
that I need to host.

610
00:27:29,279 --> 00:27:30,240
Chief, you...

611
00:27:30,480 --> 00:27:31,799
must have another one while it's hot.

612
00:27:31,880 --> 00:27:32,519
I will, I will.

613
00:27:33,880 --> 00:27:34,200
Thanks.

614
00:27:35,480 --> 00:27:38,279
Commissar Tan, here's some garlic.

615
00:27:39,960 --> 00:27:40,200
Have some garlic.

616
00:27:41,559 --> 00:27:42,279
That's very thoughtful.

617
00:27:42,319 --> 00:27:42,960
Very thoughtful.

618
00:27:42,960 --> 00:27:43,200
Okay.

619
00:27:43,559 --> 00:27:44,359
Thank your wife for me.

620
00:27:47,680 --> 00:27:48,279
Eat up.

621
00:27:48,559 --> 00:27:49,519
So, um...

622
00:27:49,519 --> 00:27:51,119
just leave the box when you're done.

623
00:27:51,160 --> 00:27:51,799
I'll clean it up.

624
00:27:52,240 --> 00:27:52,880
Okay, will do.

625
00:27:57,720 --> 00:27:58,400
I've already eaten.

626
00:27:59,039 --> 00:27:59,640
Leave it here for now.

627
00:28:00,599 --> 00:28:01,400
How have you been lately?

628
00:28:01,559 --> 00:28:02,079
Are you busy?

629
00:28:02,839 --> 00:28:03,359
Very.

630
00:28:04,000 --> 00:28:05,799
So busy I don't have time to make buns.

631
00:28:09,440 --> 00:28:11,759
How is the SWAT team

632
00:28:12,799 --> 00:28:14,160
doing overall lately?

633
00:28:14,880 --> 00:28:15,799
We're keeping up with our training,

634
00:28:15,799 --> 00:28:16,880
and running our missions as we should.

635
00:28:16,880 --> 00:28:17,359
Everything is normal.

636
00:28:18,720 --> 00:28:19,319
What about Liao Bufan?

637
00:28:20,799 --> 00:28:21,359
Same as usual.

638
00:28:21,839 --> 00:28:24,160
He's leading all missions and training.

639
00:28:26,279 --> 00:28:27,240
Let me guess.

640
00:28:28,279 --> 00:28:30,480
I didn't let you join the task force,

641
00:28:31,160 --> 00:28:32,319
so he's really upset?

642
00:28:33,880 --> 00:28:35,559
It'd be a lie to say he isn't.

643
00:28:36,519 --> 00:28:38,480
But it's also true that he hasn't

644
00:28:39,079 --> 00:28:39,759
let it affect his work.

645
00:28:42,480 --> 00:28:42,920
What about you?

646
00:28:44,200 --> 00:28:45,599
I'm not upset, but I have some thoughts.

647
00:28:46,559 --> 00:28:47,680
Not upset, but you have thoughts.

648
00:28:48,559 --> 00:28:49,880
So that's why you didn't bring buns.

649
00:28:50,799 --> 00:28:52,000
You brought your thoughts instead, right?

650
00:28:52,000 --> 00:28:54,279
I came with three things we "cannot" do.

651
00:28:56,680 --> 00:28:57,119
Let's hear them.

652
00:28:58,000 --> 00:28:59,079
What are these three things?

653
00:29:01,599 --> 00:29:02,079
First.

654
00:29:03,000 --> 00:29:04,400
The undercover operation at Mingliu Club

655
00:29:04,440 --> 00:29:06,200
that uncovered the money laundering ring,

656
00:29:06,759 --> 00:29:09,720
We cannot use this achievement

657
00:29:09,799 --> 00:29:11,160
to negotiate terms with you.

658
00:29:13,559 --> 00:29:14,359
Sticking to the facts,

659
00:29:15,680 --> 00:29:16,559
and not exaggerating.

660
00:29:17,200 --> 00:29:17,759
That's an improvement.

661
00:29:18,799 --> 00:29:19,359
Second.

662
00:29:20,440 --> 00:29:23,599
We cannot use Comrade Lu Zhong's sacrifice

663
00:29:24,880 --> 00:29:26,400
as leverage for the SWAT team

664
00:29:26,440 --> 00:29:27,839
to join the task force

665
00:29:28,559 --> 00:29:29,799
and make demands of you.

666
00:29:31,200 --> 00:29:32,200
Personal feelings

667
00:29:32,440 --> 00:29:34,680
must never override the organization.

668
00:29:35,799 --> 00:29:37,359
In building our team, this is

669
00:29:38,200 --> 00:29:39,319
the most important quality,

670
00:29:40,240 --> 00:29:40,640
right?

671
00:29:41,079 --> 00:29:41,440
Yes.

672
00:29:41,440 --> 00:29:42,400
You made two very good points.

673
00:29:42,880 --> 00:29:43,559
What's the third?

674
00:29:44,519 --> 00:29:44,960
Third.

675
00:29:45,559 --> 00:29:48,079
You can't ignore the SWAT team's progress.

676
00:29:51,079 --> 00:29:52,519
I... I really want to talk about

677
00:29:52,519 --> 00:29:54,400
Liao Bufan's progress.

678
00:29:55,799 --> 00:29:57,880
Before, at the investment conference,

679
00:29:58,200 --> 00:29:59,759
the day Comrade Lu Zhong died...

680
00:30:00,440 --> 00:30:03,200
He was so emotional back then

681
00:30:03,759 --> 00:30:04,480
that he even tried to hit me.

682
00:30:05,119 --> 00:30:06,519
He even tore my clothes right here.

683
00:30:06,559 --> 00:30:07,319
You still remember that day.

684
00:30:08,599 --> 00:30:09,720
But last week,

685
00:30:10,200 --> 00:30:11,039
during the bomb defusal at the pier,

686
00:30:11,599 --> 00:30:14,240
when the suspect, Heihai, yelled,

687
00:30:14,680 --> 00:30:17,240
"Yes, yes, yes, I killed Lu Zhong!"

688
00:30:18,079 --> 00:30:19,440
If it had been the old Liao Bufan,

689
00:30:19,440 --> 00:30:20,920
he would have rushed up

690
00:30:21,000 --> 00:30:21,839
and started a fight.

691
00:30:22,680 --> 00:30:25,640
But now, he stood by his duty.

692
00:30:25,960 --> 00:30:27,559
He didn't let his personal emotions

693
00:30:28,440 --> 00:30:30,519
affect the overall mission,

694
00:30:30,720 --> 00:30:31,799
and ultimately defused the bomb.

695
00:30:34,680 --> 00:30:35,200
So?

696
00:30:37,000 --> 00:30:40,039
So you guys think

697
00:30:40,119 --> 00:30:41,680
you're ready to join the task force?

698
00:30:43,680 --> 00:30:44,119
Yes.

699
00:30:45,079 --> 00:30:48,400
They've learned to endure the pain

700
00:30:49,480 --> 00:30:51,319
while gripping their blades tight,

701
00:30:52,160 --> 00:30:53,880
and hold them even tighter and steadier.

702
00:30:56,279 --> 00:30:56,720
Go on.

703
00:30:59,519 --> 00:31:01,720
After I joined the SWAT team,

704
00:31:01,759 --> 00:31:05,240
I truly saw the changes in the members.

705
00:31:05,880 --> 00:31:08,240
I saw their dedication.

706
00:31:09,400 --> 00:31:10,599
Not being allowed to know about the case?

707
00:31:11,119 --> 00:31:11,799
No problem.

708
00:31:12,640 --> 00:31:14,480
During all the screening operations,

709
00:31:15,279 --> 00:31:17,279
they didn't utter a single complaint.

710
00:31:18,000 --> 00:31:18,920
They went wherever they were directed.

711
00:31:20,000 --> 00:31:21,240
Not being allowed to join the task force?

712
00:31:22,079 --> 00:31:22,680
No problem.

713
00:31:23,720 --> 00:31:25,240
To train for the skills competition,

714
00:31:25,960 --> 00:31:26,960
they put whatever grievances they had

715
00:31:27,440 --> 00:31:28,480
aside for the moment.

716
00:31:30,200 --> 00:31:31,119
A team like this

717
00:31:31,839 --> 00:31:33,279
deserves to be acknowledged.

718
00:31:33,920 --> 00:31:35,200
They deserve to be seen.

719
00:31:38,039 --> 00:31:38,799
Hold on, Tan Yan.

720
00:31:40,480 --> 00:31:41,599
When did I ever

721
00:31:41,599 --> 00:31:43,279
not acknowledge your team?

722
00:31:46,440 --> 00:31:47,960
You think keeping you off the task force

723
00:31:49,079 --> 00:31:50,559
means you're being overlooked?

724
00:31:51,799 --> 00:31:52,279
Tan Yan,

725
00:31:53,279 --> 00:31:54,240
being so emotional

726
00:31:54,240 --> 00:31:55,359
won't solve the problem.

727
00:31:56,559 --> 00:31:57,480
What does a task force do?

728
00:31:58,359 --> 00:32:01,599
Investigating, analyzing, gathering proof.

729
00:32:02,559 --> 00:32:03,559
The SWAT team's duty

730
00:32:04,079 --> 00:32:05,640
is to handle emergencies

731
00:32:05,880 --> 00:32:06,880
and overcome tough challenges.

732
00:32:07,519 --> 00:32:09,880
It's always about holding the final line,

733
00:32:10,480 --> 00:32:13,160
and strictly obeying superiors' commands.

734
00:32:13,920 --> 00:32:14,559
I understand.

735
00:32:15,119 --> 00:32:15,839
I... I'm not saying this

736
00:32:15,839 --> 00:32:17,279
to complain on their behalf.

737
00:32:18,160 --> 00:32:18,440
I...

738
00:32:20,160 --> 00:32:21,799
I just want you to know

739
00:32:22,480 --> 00:32:23,599
that our team has changed.

740
00:32:24,079 --> 00:32:25,319
We've completely transformed.

741
00:32:25,960 --> 00:32:27,599
We can prioritize the big picture.

742
00:32:27,599 --> 00:32:28,119
Isn't this exactly

743
00:32:28,119 --> 00:32:30,079
the reason I sent you to the SWAT team?

744
00:32:30,759 --> 00:32:34,240
You just returned to SWAT's true essence.

745
00:32:35,160 --> 00:32:35,880
To be perfectly honest,

746
00:32:36,319 --> 00:32:37,400
the SWAT detachment right now

747
00:32:37,839 --> 00:32:40,599
is just back at the normal starting line.

748
00:32:41,720 --> 00:32:43,279
Yet here you are listing off points.

749
00:32:43,960 --> 00:32:45,119
What right do you have to negotiate?

750
00:32:47,640 --> 00:32:49,599
Don't get emotional either.

751
00:32:50,880 --> 00:32:52,680
Whether we can join the task force

752
00:32:53,640 --> 00:32:54,279
is up to you.

753
00:32:55,160 --> 00:32:55,720
But I...

754
00:32:55,720 --> 00:32:56,559
Don't I have to

755
00:32:56,839 --> 00:32:58,279
make the SWAT detachment's progress

756
00:32:59,359 --> 00:33:00,480
clear to you?

757
00:33:01,880 --> 00:33:02,759
If I don't speak up,

758
00:33:03,640 --> 00:33:04,799
no one else will speak for them.

759
00:33:04,799 --> 00:33:06,480
Nobody speaks for them?

760
00:33:11,279 --> 00:33:12,680
You guys come to me time and again,

761
00:33:12,759 --> 00:33:13,799
one after another.

762
00:33:15,359 --> 00:33:15,839
Tan Yan,

763
00:33:16,680 --> 00:33:18,440
it's fine if you speak for them.

764
00:33:19,480 --> 00:33:21,440
The problem is what you say

765
00:33:21,559 --> 00:33:22,359
and how you say it.

766
00:33:24,480 --> 00:33:25,279
By acting like this,

767
00:33:26,279 --> 00:33:27,319
how can you put my mind at ease?

768
00:33:31,759 --> 00:33:32,680
As the political commissar,

769
00:33:32,960 --> 00:33:34,039
leading this team well

770
00:33:34,240 --> 00:33:35,480
is more important than easing your mind.

771
00:33:43,359 --> 00:33:43,960
I have to say,

772
00:33:52,200 --> 00:33:53,000
this kid...

773
00:33:54,079 --> 00:33:55,160
has really been brainwashed.

774
00:34:06,759 --> 00:34:07,640
It's been over a decade.

775
00:34:08,079 --> 00:34:09,719
Today, I finally got some satisfaction.

776
00:34:15,639 --> 00:34:16,519
Just now,

777
00:34:17,280 --> 00:34:18,320
I put Lao Guo in his place.

778
00:34:18,760 --> 00:34:19,559
Right to his face.

779
00:34:39,840 --> 00:34:40,719
Hello. Your noodles.

780
00:34:41,079 --> 00:34:41,440
Okay.

781
00:35:03,119 --> 00:35:04,039
I was just in a meeting.

782
00:35:04,599 --> 00:35:05,920
For real? How did Lao Guo react?

783
00:35:09,679 --> 00:35:10,679
Way to go, Lao Tan.

784
00:35:11,079 --> 00:35:12,679
You really stood your ground this time.

785
00:35:16,960 --> 00:35:18,079
Let's meet up tonight.

786
00:35:18,360 --> 00:35:19,000
How did you shut him down?

787
00:35:19,159 --> 00:35:20,119
Tell us all the details.

788
00:36:57,039 --> 00:36:57,719
With you acting like this,

789
00:36:58,880 --> 00:36:59,840
how can I not worry about you?

790
00:37:01,719 --> 00:37:02,639
As the political commissar,

791
00:37:02,920 --> 00:37:03,760
leading this team well

792
00:37:04,079 --> 00:37:05,519
is more important than easing your worries.

793
00:38:08,840 --> 00:38:09,440
Do it.

794
00:40:08,920 --> 00:40:09,639
Failed again.

795
00:40:15,760 --> 00:40:17,000
It's been too long.

796
00:40:18,679 --> 00:40:19,440
I'm getting rusty.

797
00:40:37,159 --> 00:40:37,800
Ah Yuan.

798
00:40:40,679 --> 00:40:42,119
My patience is limited.

799
00:40:44,000 --> 00:40:45,480
If you fail again,

800
00:40:49,960 --> 00:40:51,960
I'll reunite you with your son tomorrow.

801
00:41:08,599 --> 00:41:08,880
Come on.

802
00:41:45,320 --> 00:41:45,880
Ah Yuan.

803
00:41:47,519 --> 00:41:48,079
Get some rest.

804
00:41:49,519 --> 00:41:50,639
Tomorrow morning at eight,

805
00:41:51,920 --> 00:41:52,519
I'll wake you up.

806
00:43:12,280 --> 00:43:14,199
I want this cancer hidden in Hongye

807
00:43:14,199 --> 00:43:15,079
completely uprooted.

808
00:43:32,239 --> 00:43:32,719
Lao Tan!

809
00:43:33,320 --> 00:43:34,480
Ambulance, hurry! Hurry!
